("ADJ-133","effective – more effective – most effective","'Affective' relates to emotions. The word for 'works well' is 'effective'.","EFFECTIVE has an EFFECT — it works.","'Effective from Monday' = starting from Monday (official notices).","Write a sentence about an effective way to learn new words.",None,"effective vs efficient","Effective = gets the result. Efficient = gets it without waste of time or money.","This medicine is very affective.","This medicine is very effective."),
