("ADJ-135","efficient – more efficient – most efficient","Use 'efficient AT' a job or skill.","EFFICIENT: no wasted Effort.","'Energy-efficient' appliances use less power.","Write a sentence about how to be more efficient in the morning.",None,"efficient vs effective","Efficient = no waste. Effective = achieves the goal."),
("ADJ-136","outstanding – (not usually compared)","'Outstanding' is an adjective, not a noun; it must describe something.","OUT-STANDING: STANDS OUT from the crowd.","'Outstanding payment' = money still unpaid.","Write a sentence about an outstanding performance you saw.",None,"outstanding vs excellent","Same praise level. Outstanding also means 'unpaid' or 'not yet done'."),
