("ADJ-144","urgent – more urgent – most urgent","To describe a verb like 'come', use the adverb 'urgently'.","URGENT: the letter U looks like a siren.","'Urgent' is a common email subject tag.","Write a sentence about an urgent message you received.",None,"urgent vs important","Important = matters a lot. Urgent = must be done now. Not everything important is urgent.","Please come urgent.","Please come urgently."),
